249 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 215 0 R
/E (I'm Jing Yuan, a Secondary 4 student from Singapore who gets excited about understanding how things work and building cool stuff. I'm the kind of person who dives deep into interests.  I'll self-teach Fusion 360, pick up competitive programming in C++, and spend hours designing and iterating, just because I'm curious. I like LEGO Technic and have bulid set like All-Terrain Vehicle \(42139\), I enjoy problem-solving, and I'm driven by that moment when something clicks into place.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
