424 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 231 0 R
/E (My school gives students access to laser-cut wood STEM kits they can build during recess. I built eight over time, ranging from a solar-powered fan to a self-balancing car robot. Each one meant wiring components and fitting them into a laser-cut frame, and sometimes tweaking the design to get it working better. I kept picking up new kits because I wanted to see what I could build next.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [9]
>>
