/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 232 0 R
/E (I own two 3D printers, a K1C and an A1 Mini, the second given to me by my coach. I use them to solve everyday problems, like a tripod so I could record videos hands-free while working, and a custom holder I designed to fit my screwdriver and bits. I also print mechanisms to understand how they work, like a Wankel engine and a V8 engine. Along the way I picked up tools like heat inserts, soldering iron, and learned to design custom parts as well as modify existing ones.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [7]
>>
